58
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:51,920
Today.

59
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,640
We have to win.

60
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,800
Yeah, we have to win.

61
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,520
