Ke Uh-Oh.

107
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,840
Ding Staring.

108
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,560
Jin Goofy.

109
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,800
I'm speechless.

110
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,480
What kind of performance is this?

111
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,640
I'm speechless.

112
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,480
(I'm speechless. Mickey Mouse version)
What kind of performance is this?

113
