I know.

121
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,480
(What does that mean?)
What do you mean by follow them?

122
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,360
What do you mean?

123
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,560
Follow these two.

124
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,880
The most important thing
is to follow me.

125
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:48,880
You only sang one song together.

126
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,680
How did that song go again?

127
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:57,190
