Is it this one?

137
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:17,300
(A total hit)

138
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:18,960
Can I ask something?

139
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:21,640
(Asking)
Will we recreate that scene today?

140
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:25,760
(More iconic moments)
We can recreate even more iconic scenes.

141
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:29,200
Because beginners have amazing luck.

142
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,280
