Who's your blind guess for the killer?

143
00:04:31,540 --> 00:04:32,740
(Curious little fox)

144
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,640
They are not.

145
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,120
(The honored detectives)
So it's just the four of us, right?

146
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,360
Listen,

147
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,280
during the game,

148
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,240
you can follow anyone,

149
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,200
just don't follow her.

150
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,160
(What do you mean?)

151
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:42,920
Why?

152
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,560
If you follow her,

153
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,000
(Fear level doubles)
you'll be twice as scared.

154
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Let me ask you.

155
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,960
Are you scared?

156
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,600
I'm not scared.

157
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,800
Really?

158
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,680
(Addicted anyway)
I'm terrible, but I love playing anyway.

159
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,840
Just have fun.

160
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:55,280
Zhou Keyu is almost six foot three.

161
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,080
I look like a figure next to him.

162
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:58,860
(Getting ready to film)

163
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,640
How tall are you?

164
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,640
(A full six foot three) Six foot three.

165
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,920
I look like a figure next to him.

166
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,320
How is he so tall?

167
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,440
(Hard to believe)
They're all very tall.

168
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:08,560
(Instant height boost)

169
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,400
Actually, you're pretty tall.

170
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,120
You're already considered tall.

171
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,720
I'm five-five.

172
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,120
Five-five is pretty tall.

173
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:16,080
Still not compared
to you six-three people.

174
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,360
(They're all six-three)
They're all six-three.

175
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,960
(The land of giants)
The three of us are all six-three.

176
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,240
(Land of giants)
They're all six-three.

177
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,400
We're like tiny figurines.

178
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,280
(You can tell at a glance)
Yeah.

179
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:26,080
(100% perfect match)
My little pet suits me today.

180
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,920
(Fully immersed in the mystery)
We have to stay fully in character.

181
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,880
Okay, anything else to tell me?

182
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:31,680
When we act,

183
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,400
