184
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,320
When we perform later, it's like,

185
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:37,840
"My survival rule is,
I don't do that job."

186
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,080
(System detected a drama bug)
"I'm not doing that."

187
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,160
That's how you have to act.

188
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,860
(Giving the newbie a taste of the drama)

189
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,800
It's really like that.

190
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,000
(The real deal)
She's not kidding.

191
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,480
(Not exaggerated at all)
That's really how she is.

192
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:48,080
(That's so shy)
I can't do it.

193
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:48,760
Look.

194
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:51,240
Why do they bring in so many actors?

195
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,480
It's because we have this...

196
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,480
(Instantly in character)
This kind of...

197
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,560
This kind of vibe.

198
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:58,180
(Basic stuff)

199
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,520
When you're happy, act happy.

200
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,840
If you cry, really cry.

201
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,960
If you don't act like that later,

202
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,560
or if your acting isn't good,

203
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,560
