Yeah, it might push us later.

773
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,000
What is this?

774
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:51,240
This mochi. It's super delicious.

775
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:53,160
Try another one.

776
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:54,360
