Zero, one, zero, eight.

777
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:56,840
(That's too simple)
Would they really set it like this?

778
00:22:56,840 --> 00:22:57,680
Zero, seven, zero, one.

779
00:22:58,080 --> 00:22:59,200
Zero, four, zero, two.

780
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,080
