787
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:11,920
It smells so good.

788
00:23:12,300 --> 00:23:13,140
(I want some)

789
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:16,400
You think it's just right, right?

790
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:18,000
The sauce will make it too salty.

791
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:18,800
Everyone,

792
00:23:18,800 --> 00:23:19,640
